fix(nginx): set control-ui base path for OpenClaw 2026.8.2

OpenClaw 2026.8.2 already includes data-openclaw-control-ui-base-path=\"\" in
the ControlUI HTML. Replace the empty value with the HA Ingress path via
sub_filter so assets and WebSocket URLs resolve correctly inside Ingress.
This fixes the 404 errors on /assets/* and the blank WebUI iframe.

Bump version to 0.7.10.14.
